    "chunk_text": "de \u00e6t Swifte mid ehta pundun. \u00deonne synd festermen, Frena & Vlf eorles suna & Osfer\u00f0 Fry\u00f0egistes suna & Hudeman & Sumerlyda \u00deis synd \u00fea festermen \u00fee Wulfgeat & Gyrping fundon \u00feam abbod \u00e6ddulfe \u00fea hi \u00feat lande guldun \u00e6t \u00deonne is an Hundulf, o\u00f0er is Ulf Doddes sune, III \u00feurlac, IIII Sigar, V \u00feurold on Macesige. \u00dees landes is under eal IX & XX gedale. On \u00feissum gewrite cy\u00f0 hwet \u00fea festermen synd \u00fees landes ceapes \u00fee Adeluuold biscop gebohte \u00e6t Eige \u00e6rest on Gyrewerde XXIIII \u00e6cera & \u00feerto god gebotl & him man sealde wi\u00f0 XII mancusas goldes & him weron festermen, Frena & Sigefer\u00f0 & Oggod. \u00dea bohte man \u00e6t Mannele & \u00e6t his wife LX \u00e6cera mid \u00ferim pundum & mid anum yre. & him weron festermen \u00feurlac, & Oggod. \u00dea bohte man \u00e6t Tuce & \u00e6t hire sune Clacce LX \u00e6cera \u00e6lc mid X penegum. & hire weron festermen Gunna & Hundulf & Saxa & \u00feurfer\u00f0. & \u00e6t \u00fean XX \u00e6cera \u00fea man bohte \u00e6t Vfige \u00e6lne mid XX penegun & mid VIII penegun. & him weron festermen Tunna his feder & Vlf & Osulfe. & \u00e6t is modur Aswige man bohte LX \u00e6cera elcne mid X penegun. & him weron festermen Wulgar & Eadric & Osfer\u00f0 & Styrcyr & \u00e6tlebrant. \u00deonne bohte man \u00e6t Wulno\u00f0e metere Oxanege. \u00deonne on Oxanige is ametenes wudes &",
